{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0fb861cb-c351-866f-bd77-abd6116b5c17",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T13:38:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I am calling about water in the street. Storm drain, I think. It is not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure, I can help with that. Where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:30:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "128 Pelham Street, on Historic Hill. The water comes down the hill from the next street over and goes straight into the yard. Every time it rains hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "128 Pelham, got it. Let me write this down. So runoff coming downhill from the parallel street, and it's pooling at your place. Is the drain right in front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drain is at the corner, maybe two houses up. It is full of leaves and, I don't know, sand. The water just goes around it. Then it comes to my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that happens when the grate gets clogged up. Is this since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It is Tuesday now and there is still a big puddle. Not small. It is like a pond by the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two days later and still standing. Okay. Is it in the house at all, or just the yard and sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the yard and the sidewalk. The house is okay. But it is annoying, because I have to walk around it every day, with my shoes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. [pause] Sorry, typing. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I worry also. There are kids who walk to the bus on this street. And people with dogs, they walk right there by the water. If it freezes tonight, it will be ice. Somebody will slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a fair point, I'll put that in the notes so the crew knows it's a walking route. Temps are supposed to drop tonight, so ice is possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I want to know, when did they last come by? To clean this drain. Because it looks like nobody has touched it for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the drain on the map and see what's logged for that area. Hang on a sec."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:33:30-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm looking. So I've got the catch basin near the corner there. The last logged cleaning I'm seeing is from the fall, but it doesn't show anything after the storm. Nobody's been out there since this weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the fall. So, months. And with the leaves, and then the storm. It makes sense then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does. Those fall leaves pack in, then the storm dumps sand and debris on top. I'll put in a work order for a crew to clear it and look at the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. When will they come? Today? Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say within the next few days. They've got a stack of storm calls, so it's a window, not a set hour. Since you've got the standing water and the freeze coming, I'll flag it as a safety item."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please do that. I don't want to call again next week and say the same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me grab a callback number, in case dispatch needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-eight. And it's under Leila, right? How do you spell the last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leila Abdi. L-E-I-L-A. A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Abdi, perfect. And you're the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I own the house. It is mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So, 128 Pelham Street, clogged catch basin near the corner, runoff coming down from the next street into your yard, standing water since Sunday, concern about kids and dog walkers and ice. That sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Sorry, one more thing. The water also comes from the other street, the one above. Is that a different problem? Maybe there is a drain there also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. If you know which street it is I can add a note for the crew to check the upper end too. Do you know the cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't remember the name. It is the street above, uphill, parallel. I will look at the sign tomorrow and call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll just note that crew should look uphill as well, and if you get the name, call back and reference this order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, you are helpful. I am sorry, I am a little bit short today. I am trying to decide between two used cars, and the seller keeps calling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, that's a lot to juggle. Used car shopping will do that. Hopefully one of them's a winner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe. One is cheaper but has more miles. I will think. Anyway, back to the drain, please do not forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in, I won't lose it. You should get a call if the crew has trouble getting at it, and otherwise you'll just see them out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if the ice comes before they come, should I do something? Put salt on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Salt or sand on your own stretch of sidewalk is a good idea, sure. Just try to keep it from washing into the drain. And stay clear of the deep part of the puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will do that. Thank you, Kevin. May God bless you and your family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, that's kind. You take care, Leila. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
